    "detailed_description": "This is a block assembly simulator.<br />\r\nYou can use your mouse to manipulate the Ui, summon the blocks, and place them in the desired position.<br />\r\nKeyboard operations allow you to install, erase, or redirect blocks.<br />\r\nYou can use a variety of colors to color your installed blocks.<br />\r\nIf you've installed the block, you can save it, and you can call it up.<br />\r\nThe background music does not exist at the momentarily. I have an intention to add it later.<br />\r\nAssemble the blocks that you want to have!",
